{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ANALOG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Analog </i>is a game series that combines a <strong>first person horror experience</strong> with <strong>analog horror</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798930/extras/50bf219acd6c8d9a2061927e891f3c7b.poster.avif?t=1764282143\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798930/extras/50bf219acd6c8d9a2061927e891f3c7b.webm?t=1764282143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798930/extras/50bf219acd6c8d9a2061927e891f3c7b.mp4?t=1764282143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MIRROR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIRROR</strong> is the second game in the <i>Analog</i> series. You\u2019re spending the evening alone when you find a forgotten 90's shooter game \u2014 an unopened gift from years ago. Out of curiosity, you decide to play. What begins as a retro distraction gradually shifts, revealing a history the game was never meant to carry.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798930/extras/da79979361925bd0e97a350ade3f168e.poster.avif?t=1764282143\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798930/extras/da79979361925bd0e97a350ade3f168e.webm?t=1764282143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798930/extras/da79979361925bd0e97a350ade3f168e.mp4?t=1764282143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground